      "description": "Long & multi exposure photography with real-time tracking.\n\nTrack moving or still objects with a real-time preview to create smooth background and foreground blur.\nYou can also record first and apply tracking afterward, which is ideal for faster-moving objects.\nCombine multiple exposures and step back to remove the last one.\n\nChoose between four different capture modes: \nBlend – smooth, natural long exposure results\nAdditive – bright light trails\nNegative - creative and experimental dark exposures\nZebra - black & white pattern effect\n\n\nAdditional features:\n+ three tracking points available\n+ Mirror Mode\n+ long exposure up to 30 minutes\n+ record video during live capture\n+ capture images in 4K\n+ and much more...\n\nNo subscription. Pay once. Future updates included",
